        "original_id": "14ffdcda-c30a-5c9b-b576-0f2a39957dc4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Walls Have Eyes\n- People: Maurice Gibb, Tom Dowd\n- Organizations: EMI America Records, Polydor Records, Bee Gees\n\nFacts:\n- In November 1985, Walls Have Eyes was released on EMI America Records in the United States and on Polydor Records in the rest of the world.\n- Walls Have Eyes was produced by Maurice Gibb and Tom Dowd.\n- Maurice Ernest Gibb was born on 22 December 1949 and died on 12 January 2003.\n- Maurice Gibb was a singer, songwriter, multi-instrumentalist, and record producer.\n- Maurice Gibb achieved fame as a member of the Bee Gees.",
